    {
        "id": "aquarium_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "═══════════════ AQUARIUM LIGHT CONTROLS ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Aquarium Light Control\n\n**Flow Number:** 500\n**Domain:** Home Automation\n\n### Purpose\nControls aquarium light via Tasmota device with manual and automatic scheduling.\n\n### Hardware\n- Device: sursaAcvariu (Tasmota)\n- Control: Single relay (POWER)\n\n### Features\n- Manual on/off control via Dashboard\n- Automatic daily schedule (06:00 ON, 22:00 OFF)\n- Dashboard 2.0 UI\n- State tracking in global context\n- Decoupled switch (prevents feedback loops)\n- Timer-based automation\n\n### MQTT Topics\n- Status: stat/sursaAcvariu/POWER\n- Command: cmnd/sursaAcvariu/POWER\n\n### Schedule\n- **Morning ON:** 06:00 (daily)\n- **Night OFF:** 22:00 (daily)\n- Uses node-red-contrib-timerswitch\n\n### Dependencies\n- mqtt_broker_local\n- Dashboard 2.0 (@flowfuse/node-red-dashboard)\n- node-red-contrib-timerswitch (for automation)\n\n### UI Components\n- ui-switch (Dashboard 2.0)\n- Located in 'Acvariu' group on 'Home' page",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
